@baseUrl = http://localhost:8200

### Apply resilience preset
POST {{baseUrl}}/sim/admin/scenarios/resilience

### HIS with injected latency
GET {{baseUrl}}/sim/his/appointments/apt-resilience-001

### Payment may fail (~20%)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sim/payment/validate/apt-resilience-001

### Vonage should fail (100% error rate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sim/vonage/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "apt-resilience-001"
}

### ACS fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/sim/acs/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "apt-resilience-001"
}
